                        </p>
                        <p class="desc">Datuk Chef Wan is one of Malaysia’s most celebrated culinary figures. Known for his vibrant personality and dedication to preserving traditional Malaysian cuisine, he has introduced Malaysian flavors to international audiences through television programs, cookbooks, and global food events. <br> <br>
